WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.975
Reflex, honestly: one form, failure kept.

00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:10.000
One frozen task on the local commerce server: add an item, check out.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.075
Level zero hits the DOM: cart table found. Zero vision dollars.

00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:23.300
The dropdown mis-grounds. Surprise fires.  Halt. No blind retry.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:30.500
Re-ground on a crop. The targeted model resolves it. One cent, worst case.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.275
The verifier confirms every field. The journal keeps the episode.

00:00:37.475 --> 00:00:41.900
Total spend: one cent. Latency: unoptimized, and labeled so.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:48.825
What is next: the real browser suite, defect fixes, measured latencies.

00:00:50.025 --> 00:00:54.525
A seed, with its failure kept.  Follow the build.
